  "summary": "Malicious code in trickz-casino (npm)",
  "details": "Trickz-casino@1.0.0 is a placeholder package from a known-malicious casino-promotion campaign. It ships an empty module (module.exports = {}) and a French-language SEO-spam README promoting \"Trickz Casino\" (homepage trickz-fr[.]fr). It has no install scripts, no dependencies, and no executable payload in this version; it functions as a parked/SEO package within a broader campaign of casino-themed packages.",
